---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Kvisl" description="How Kvisl handles personal information and site data.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="policy-updated">Last updated 19 September 2026</p>

    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p><span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> collects only the information reasonably needed to operate the site, deliver requested services, protect the service, and understand basic technical performance.</p>

      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>If you subscribe, contact us, request republication, or submit another form, we may receive information such as your email address, name, publication or organisation, message, and the details you choose to provide.</p>

      <h2>Technical information</h2>
      <p>Our hosting and infrastructure providers may process standard technical data such as IP address, browser type, device information, request time, referring page, and error or security logs. We use this information for security, reliability, abuse prevention, and troubleshooting rather than behavioural advertising.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
      <p>The site may use essential browser storage for features such as remembering your light or dark appearance preference. We do not use that preference to build an advertising profile.</p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>to deliver subscriptions and respond to requests;</li>
        <li>to administer publication, rights, and republication enquiries;</li>
        <li>to maintain security, diagnose faults, and prevent abuse;</li>
        <li>to comply with legal obligations where applicable.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell personal information or subscriber lists to advertisers. We may share limited information with service providers that host, secure, deliver, or maintain the site, and when disclosure is required by law or necessary to protect the service and its users.</p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep personal information only for as long as it is reasonably needed for the purpose for which it was collected, for record-keeping, security, dispute resolution, or legal obligations. Subscription information is removed or suppressed when you unsubscribe, subject to limited records needed to honour that choice.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can unsubscribe through the link in an email. You may also ask us to correct or delete information you have provided, subject to legal and operational requirements. Use the official Contact page for privacy requests.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable technical and organisational safeguards, but no internet service can guarantee absolute security. Avoid sending passwords, private keys, or other highly sensitive credentials through ordinary forms or email.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p><span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> is a general-audience publication and is not directed to children. We do not knowingly seek personal information from children through the site.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy as the site, services, or legal requirements change. The date above will be revised when a material update is published.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
